27	Material Handling	\N	EL1000	Bottle Elevator	Vertical elevator for bottle elevation between conveyors or process levels.	The EL1000 Bottle Elevator is built for vertical transfer of bottles between multiple conveyor heights. With a cleated belt and photoeye sensors, it ensures consistent bottle spacing and prevents line backups.	["Cleated vertical belt system", "Photoeye bottle detection sensors", "Variable speed motor drive", "Low-maintenance, food-grade components"]	["Filling Lines", "Capping Lines", "Industrial Automation"]	\N	\N	\N	/images/products/handling-el1000.jpg	\N	\N	info@psrautomation.com	952-233-1441	Active	2026-03-25 10:35:51.545292-04	2026-03-25 10:35:51.545292-04
29	Material Handling	\N	TS1000	Transfer Station	Automated transfer station for smooth bottle handoff between conveyors.	The TS1000 Transfer Station synchronizes two conveyor lines, providing a smooth, jam-free transfer of containers between stages in the bottling process. It features servo synchronization and independent belt control.	["Servo synchronization between conveyors", "Adjustable belt speeds", "Stainless steel guard enclosure", "Easy maintenance design"]	["Filling Lines", "Packaging Integration", "Material Conveyance"]	\N	\N	\N	/images/products/handling-ts1000.jpg	\N	\N	info@psrautomation.com	952-233-1441	Active	2025-10-21 17:15:59.004-04	2026-03-25 10:35:51.552582-04
